<view class="page"><text>本人微信身份登录 H5</text><text>不要求邮箱，不授管理员。请仅确认自己正在操作的浏览器。</text><input value="{{challenge}}" data-field="challenge" bindinput="input" disabled="{{pending}}" placeholder="粘贴本人 H5 交接码"/><picker wx:if="{{contexts.length}}" range="{{contexts}}" range-key="scene" value="{{contextIndex}}" bindchange="chooseContext" disabled="{{pending}}"><view>{{scene || "选择本人已有授权场景"}}</view></picker><button bindtap="describe" disabled="{{pending}}" loading="{{pending}}">核对原微信身份与浏览器</button><view wx:if="{{description}}"><text>{{description.origin}}</text><text>{{description.scene}}</text><text selectable="true">{{description.verification}}</text><button bindtap="confirm" disabled="{{pending}}">确认本人浏览器</button></view><button bindtap="cancel">取消本页确认</button><text>{{status}}</text></view>
